stories[9]=["A primeira viagem de Ben", "When Ben was ten, his family visited a small island.~Quando Ben tinha dez anos, a família visitou uma ilha pequena.|They took a boat early in the morning, and the sea was calm.~Pegaram um barco de manhã cedo, e o mar estava calmo.|Ben used to be afraid of water, so he held his mother’s hand.~Ben tinha medo de água, então segurou a mão da mãe.|When they arrived, the beach was empty and the sand was warm.~Quando chegaram, a praia estava vazia e a areia, morna.|He found a pretty shell and put it in his pocket.~Ele achou uma concha bonita e a pôs no bolso.|Then he lost it, and he cried for ten minutes.~Depois ele a perdeu e chorou por dez minutos.|His father did not get angry, and they looked for it together.~O pai não ficou bravo, e eles a procuraram juntos.|Two hours later, Ben found the shell under a blue towel.~Duas horas depois, Ben achou a concha debaixo de uma toalha azul.|That night, he slept with the shell next to his bed.~Naquela noite, ele dormiu com a concha ao lado da cama.|Today, Ben still keeps it on his desk at work.~Hoje, Ben ainda a guarda na mesa do trabalho."];
